{"parse":{"title":"铃兰之剑：十月日历","pageid":3184,"revid":6751,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98\" title=\"专题\">专题</a> &gt; <b>铃兰之剑：十月日历</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.7C.E4.B9.9D.E6.9C.88.E6.97.A5.E5.8E.86\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"铃兰之剑|九月日历\">铃兰之剑|九月日历</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91%EF%BC%9A%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A5%E5%8E%86&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：铃兰之剑|九月日历\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-30 16:51<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FUPfnpeg6Zbbz-lo55uZpLQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UPfnpeg6Zbbz-lo55uZpLQ</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息243.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1e/7uawa212donuj5dja3lylyh2f0t2aae.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"120\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><font color=\"brown\"><b>秋意渐浓</b></font><br />\n铃兰小镇也在进行着<font color=\"brown\"><b>温馨的下午茶</b></font>\n<br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>麦莎</b></font>还是一如既往地<font color=\"brown\"><b>活泼</b></font>呢！<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>快乐</b></font>也感染到了<font color=\"brown\"><b>伊南娜公主</b></font>和<font color=\"brown\"><b>双子兄妹</b></font><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>阳光</b></font>洒进充满着<font color=\"brown\"><b>欢笑</b></font>的房间<br />\n真是难得的<font color=\"brown\"><b>恬静时光</b></font>呀~\n<br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>十月壁纸</b></font>这就送上<br />\n团长收好啦！\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息244.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/avipkvpjlraofon52zrdh09dciiqbn7.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" />\n<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息245.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9f/mvblmimi8n5la0gi1gremktbfhwg2ej.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"608\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261021175601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.032 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2014/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size